  "referenceNumber": "RUS2404",
  "remarks": "\nIgor Vladimirovich KIM (hereafter KIM) is an “involved person” under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground:  KIM is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit from or supporting the Government of Russia by owning or controlling an entity, Expobank, which is or has been carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian financial sector.  \n",
